From ecebda3e2d7c859da2c6882f4eef019416aa6865 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Roman Kolos <kolos.roman@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 3 Nov 2025 09:13:39 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] refactor: code cleanup and notification improvements

- ExchangeRulesService: refactor loadRulesForPair method signature
- NotificationService: remove redundant trigger update header in messages
- WorkerService: optimize notifications - remove justification text and disable AccountState for non-critical actions
- DatabaseService: code formatting cleanup
- recover-triggers.ts: formatting and whitespace cleanup

+ Added patch files for recent fixes:
  - deadlock_fix.patch: prevent deadlock in WatcherOrchestratorService
  - race_condition_fix.patch: fix race conditions in account state reading
  - api_improvements.patch: improve SyncEngine reliability
  - slowcycle_fix.patch: fix trigger update timing
  - xrp_restore_and_sync_fix.patch: restore XRP position and sync fixes
---
